"╭ ╭ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                                    Room list (continued)                          │ │"
"│ │  Tab         Next pane                         Enter       Open room and start typing        │ │"
"│ │  Shift-Tab   Previous pane                     ?           This help                         │ │"
"│▌│  Alt-←       Go to the room list              Messages                                       │ │"
"│ │  Alt-→       Go back to the chat               ↑           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↑       Go to the messages                ↓           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↓       Go to the composer                Enter       Reply to selected message         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-1       Room list                         e           Edit (own messages)               │ │"
"│ │  Alt-2       Messages                          r           React with an emoji               │ │"
"│ │  Alt-3       Composer                          Del         Delete message                    │ │"
"│ │  Alt-R       Filter rooms                      c           Copy text                         │ │"
"│ │  PgUp        Scroll messages up                C           Copy code block                   │ │"
"│ │  PgDn        Scroll messages down              O           Open in system viewer             │ │"
"│ │  Esc         Close, cancel or go back          s           Save file or picture              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-E       Emoji picker                      v           View picture                      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-A       Attach a file                     o           Open link, picture or file        │ │"
"│ │  F1          This help                         t           Open the message's thread         │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↑      Previous room                     p           Go to replied message             │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↓      Next room                         P           Pinned messages                   │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-F      Find in this room                 T           Threads of this room              │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-G      Search all rooms                  b           Save message for later, or unsave │ │"
"│ │  Alt-U       Jump to first unread              B           Saved messages and reminders      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-S       Next space (then all rooms)       d           Try decrypting again              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-O       Filter: Unread only               m           Menu for the message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-D       Filter: People only               i           Message details                   │─╯"
"│ │  Ctrl-K      Find a room                       End         Jump to newest                    │─╮"
"│ │  F2          Settings                          x           Play or stop voice and audio      │ │"
"╰─│  F3          Next theme                        Space       Pause or resume audio (mpv)       │─╯"
